me feedback.<br /> <br /> And I swear, either Xallace has a direct brain link to the OP developers, or they're stealing his ideas. The past three times that he's gone to make a fansplat, OP announced an official game of it just a month or two later. Mummy, Demon, and now Dragon. [/tinfoil hat]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T10:31:10-07:00","id":455993,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Tin Soldier</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/451589-dragon-the-inheritance?p=455882#post455882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I swear, either Xallace has a direct brain link to the OP developers, or they're stealing his ideas. The past three times that he's gone to make a fansplat, OP announced an official game of it just a month or two later. Mummy, Demon, and now Dragon. [/tinfoil hat]</div> </div> </div> </div>Once we're done with dragon let's see if we can get 4 for 4!<br /> <br /> I like the direction we recently took hoarding and I feel like we can add more to it to really make the hoard theme unique and robust. I don't want to exactly make it &quot;The Dragon Must Hoard&quot; ala Werewolf 2e but that seems to be the sort of direction the project is heading.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5463-xallace","name":"Xallace","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T16:42:26-07:00","id":457415,"title":"","content":"I've been reading <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/\" target=\"_blank\">the document<img src=\"http://cdncache-a.akamaihd.net/items/it/img/arrow-10x10.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a> and have thoroughly enjoyed what I have seen so far. I have also noticed some missing text under auxiliary legacies along the five questions and even the entirety of the core benefit of the Immortality Of Lernea <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T06:56:56-07:00","id":458034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrytofloraGardener</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/451589-dragon-the-inheritance?p=457415#post457415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been reading <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/\" target=\"_blank\">the document<img src=\"http://cdncache-a.akamaihd.net/items/it/img/arrow-10x10.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a> and have thoroughly enjoyed what I have seen so far. I have also noticed some missing text under auxiliary legacies along the five questions and even the entirety of the core benefit of the Immortality Of Lernea<br /></div> </div> </div> </div> That's because the game is still under construction. We recently divided the previous effect of Immortality of Lerna into two separate Legacies, so we're still figuring out what the effects should be. There are a fair number of other auxiliaries that need to be filled in too, so if you have any suggestions then they will be welcome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T11:32:23-07:00","id":462499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dreaminggod</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/451589-dragon-the-inheritance?p=455587#post455587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Holy damn, this is 84 pages. I'm giving it a read through, it's good so far. I've always wanted WoD-Dragons, and am slightly sad that Beast got changed from a Dragon game to, but still. This looks good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now that you've had a chance to read through, do you have any particular thoughts, questions, or ideas? It's always good to get more perspective from someone outside of the project.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-05T14:18:41-07:00","id":469619,"title":"","content":"This is a neat idea. Just curious, should you be able to activate the Intelligence boost of Heads Of Wise Council apart from the multiple heads the same way you can for the Physical Legacies? Also, unless you plan to vary it, you might want to just say that you need a Kauchaomai of 3 in order to join a Hidden House instead of repeating it for each one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-05T22:27:04-07:00","id":469883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/451589-dragon-the-inheritance?p=469619#post469619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is a neat idea. Just curious, should you be able to activate the Intelligence boost of Heads Of Wise Council apart from the multiple heads the same way you can for the Physical Legacies? Also, unless you plan to vary it, you might want to just say that you need a Kauchaomai of 3 in order to join a Hidden House instead of repeating it for each one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, you can. Though the extra heads are necessary for the benefits that reference number of heads. <br /> <br /> If we keep the current prereqs, then that might be a good thing to do. As of now they're still very rough, so they might easily change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-30T09:02:45-07:00","id":645457,"title":"","content":"I really like this. Dragon the Embers is a pretty good game but this is more what I wanted in a Dragon game. Are you planning to add any family drama to the game? Maybe something similar to wolfbloods or proximi maybe? I would like to see what happens to the children of two dragons. Do they eventually become Heirs too or some weird in between? <br /> <br /> This game has awesome crossover potential especially with Beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2276-wasitora","name":"Wasitora","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T14:31:56-07:00","id":648356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wasitora</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/451589-dragon-the-inheritance?p=645457#post645457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really like this. Dragon the Embers is a pretty good game but this is more what I wanted in a Dragon game. Are you planning to add any family drama to the game? Maybe something similar to wolfbloods or proximi maybe? I would like to see what happens to the children of two dragons. Do they eventually become Heirs too or some weird in between? <br /> <br /> This game has awesome crossover potential especially with Beast.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm glad you like it!<br /> <br /> The children of even two dragons do not necessarily become dragons themselves. It's probably more likely than it would be otherwise, but even if it did happen every time it would still be hard to tell. It's nearly impossible to tell the difference between a dragon who hasn't become an Heir Apparent and a normal human, and usually a dragon has to be at least into their teens before they have a serious identity crisis. A child younger than that would probably need to experience serious trauma to have their identity threatened enough to count for Inheritance. <br /> <br /> Now, there is a Sorcery that guarantees that a child will be a dragon, so if you want to tell that story then either a PC with high sorcery can take it, or they can talk to another sorcerer who does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T20:30:43-07:00","id":648545,"title":"","content":"There's some pretty cool stuff here, I have to admit. Personally, I think I like this better than Beast in many ways, especially with the rouge's gallery you have going on as it's important to have many interesting things to kill/be killed by.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/671-the-lone-gunman","name":"The Lone Gunman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-29T03:04:23-07:00","id":1410977,"title":"","content":"I like this concept immensely!!!!<br /> <br /> However, I have a few questions. Just note, though, that I\u2019m only asking out of a sense of prudence, since there\u2019s bound to be at least one player out there who\u2019ll want to go down this path, while also sticking to what\u2019s in the rule book. I just want the answers to be sorted out now so that STs with such a player in their troupe doesn\u2019t have to try pulling the answers out their asses and getting details confused/inconsistent.<br /> <br /> 1) If a female Heir gets pregnant in <i>Anthropos</i>, then changes into <i>Drakonos</i>, what happens to the unborn babe? And vice-versa?<br /> 2) Can an Heir in <i>Drakonos</i> even GET pregnant?? (If no, ignore questions 3 + 4. If yes, read them.)<br /> 3) Can a male Heir in <i>Drakonos</i> impregnate a female Heir in <i>Drakonos</i>? What about if one of the Heirs are in <i>Anthropos</i>? Can mortals impregnate an Heir in <i>Drakonos</i>? Are other Supernaturals able to pull it off?<br /> 4) If a female Heir gets impregnated while in <i>Drakonos</i>, be it via a male Heir in <i>Anthropos</i>/<i>Drakonos</i>, a mortal or another Supernatural, just how will the baby come out?<br /> 5) What would occur if a male Heir in <i>Drakonos</i> impregnates a mortal or another Supernatural?<br /> <br /> Etc, etc, etc, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-29T07:52:28-07:00","id":1410998,"title":"","content":"Hmm this is catching my attention! How well do dragons mingle and know about other Cultures Dragons before the world was connected by planes and Phones? What is the nature of say Ouroboros through the lens of this game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-29T12:23:23-07:00","id":1411015,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">I should note this is a pretty old thread and the participants have long 